ct]</article-title><source>Med Phys</source><year>1999</year><volume>26</volume><fpage>1100</fpage></citation></ref><ref id="b19-co13_2p061"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>LC</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoban</surname><given-names>PW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Treatment plan comparison using equivalent uniform biologically effective dose (eubed)</article-title><source>Phys Med Biol</source><year>2000</year><volume>45</volume><fpage>159</fpage><lpage>70</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10661589</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b20-co13_2p061"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Fogliata</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bolsi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Bernier</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Comparative dosimetric evaluation of simultaneous integrated boost with photon intensity modulation in head and neck cancer patients</article-title><source>Radiother Oncol</source><year>2003</year><volume>69</volume><fpage>267</fpage><lpage>75</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14644486</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>